      <div class="col-lg-5 mb-4">
        <div class="card bg-dark border-primary h-100"><div class="card-body">
          <h2 class="h4 card-title">Avatar</h2>
          <img class="float-left rounded shadow mr-3 mb-2" src="<?=$user->getAvatarURI(96)?>" srcset="<?=$user->getAvatarURI(192)?> 2x" width="96" height="96" alt="Your avatar"/>
          <p class="small">Your avatar comes from <a href="https://gravatar.com/" rel="external">Gravatar</a>, based on a <a href="https://docs.gravatar.com/api/avatars/hash/" rel="external">hash</a> of your email address. To change it, update your image on Gravatar, or change your email address.</p>
